*****************************************************************************	
* REF35 SUBCIRCUIT
* Ultra-low quiescent current: – 650 nA (typical), Precision Voltage Reference
* Model features include Output voltage, Line Regulation,
* Load Regulation, PSRR vs Frequency,
* Quiescent Current vs Temperature, 
* Line Transient response, Load Transient response, 
* Output Short Circuit Current, Startup Turn-on time, 
* Output voltage noise 0.1 to 100kHz, 
* Dropout Voltage vs Current and Temperature and 
* Output Voltage vs Temperature.
* Model temperature range is -40 to +125 deg C.
* NR pin to reduce noise
* EN pin to reduce shutdown current consumption
* Output voltage options: 
* PRODUCT: VREF:
* REF35102 1.024 V
* REF35120 1.2 V
* REF35125 1.25 V
* REF35160 1.6 V
* REF35180 1.8 V
* REF35205 2.048 V
* REF35250 2.5 V
* REF35300 3.0 V
* REF35330 3.3 V
* REF35409 4.096 V
* REF35500 5.0 V

** source REF35
.PARAM pi = 3.14159265358979
.SUBCKT REF35102 GND EN VIN NR VREF
.PARAM VrefSel= {1.024}
XU1         EN VIN NR VREF VREF GND REF35XX_0
+ PARAMS: Vout_={VrefSel}
.ENDS

