*****************************************************************************
* REF35160 SOT-23-6 (DBV) wrapper (added locally, not part of the TI file).
* Nodes follow physical pin numbers so KiCad's REF35160QDBVR symbol maps 1:1.
*   1 GND  2 GND  3 EN  4 VIN  5 NR  6 VREF
* Pins 1 and 2 are both ground on the package; they are shorted here.
*****************************************************************************
.SUBCKT REF35160_DBV GND GND2 EN VIN NR VREF
RGND GND GND2 1m
XREF GND EN VIN NR VREF REF35160
.ENDS REF35160_DBV
